offset_right = 410.0
offset_bottom = 305.0
theme = ExtResource("3_mtvw0")
text = "Please hire people with
relevant experience.
Relevant jobs:
Computer Scientist
Game Developer
Digital Artist
Storyboard Artist
Quality Assurer
Playtester
Soundtrack Designer
SFX Designer
Coder

Irrelevant jobs:
Mathematician
Youtuber
Accountant
Security Guard
Cashier
Socialite
Penguin

DO NOT ACCEPT:
FBI Agents
OSHA employees"

[node name="Skills" type="Label" parent="." unique_id=1600498268]
layout_mode = 0
offset_left = 199.0
offset_top = 32.0
offset_right = 516.0
offset_bottom = 359.0
theme = ExtResource("3_mtvw0")
text = "Each applicant must name at least three seperate skills.
Some 'skills' are just different phrasings, and do NOT count.
Accept only those with three skills:
Programmers might say:
Programmer
Coder
Programming Expert

Artists might say:
Artist
Digital Artist

People skilled in mathematics might say:
Mathematics Expert
Math Whiz
Mathematician

Great collaborators might say:
Communicator
Talkative

Some people pass off crime as a skill. These are:
Tool Reallocator
Crime Doer"

[node name="Colleges" type="Label" parent="." unique_id=1171681576]
layout_mode = 0
offset_left = 498.0
offset_top = 35.0
offset_right = 815.0
offset_bottom = 362.0
theme = ExtResource("3_mtvw0")
text = "We try to only accept the highest quality
universities. They are:

Prestige U.
James Baker U.
Citadel U.
Knowledge U.
Serpent U.
Helios Tech.
Spirit College

Acceptable, but not outstanding Universities: 
College U.
Community College
Heart College
Mountain Tech

There are a few prominent degree mills.
People get fake bachelors and masters
from them, so they do not have skills.
DO NOT ACCEPT:
Community U.
John College"

[node name="Reasons" type="Label" parent="." unique_id=488663719]
