text = "Our company motto is \"Trust Not, Fear Not, 
Fail Not\". Good reasons for wanting to join 
our company follow it, or or mission statement:
\"Encourage orderly game-design and a 
disciplined workplace.\"
Good reasons:
	Distrustful
	Fearless
	Organized
	Game Designer
	Disciplined
	Flawless

Bad Reasons:
	Talented
	Motivated
	Trusting

Disloyal Reasons:
	Asked To
	Untrustworthy"

